      "section_type": "current_landscape",
      "description": "Survey the actual tool categories in use: IDE-integrated assistants (Copilot, Cursor), chat-based coding (Claude, GPT-4o), agentic tools (Devin, OpenDevin), and specialized agents (test generation, PR review, migration). For each, give one concrete use case and one limitation. Distinguish between autocomplete, chat-driven development, and autonomous agents.",
