  "target_audience": "Mid-to-senior software engineers, engineering leads, and thoughtful practitioners who have lived through multiple technology cycles. They value depth over breadth, recognize the gap between conference talks and daily reality, and appreciate writing that names the unnamed tensions in their work. They're not looking for tutorials or hype—they're looking for articulation of what they've felt but couldn't quite say.",
