    },
    {
      "section_type": "tools_and_abstraction",
      "description": "Reflect on the explosion of tooling and abstraction layers. What we've gained (velocity, safety, scale) and what we've lost (intimacy with the machine, understanding depth, agency). Touch on the paradox: more power, less comprehension.",
