    {
      "section_type": "process_and_ritual",
      "description": "Examine how process has formalized: standups, retrospectives, RFCs, incident reviews, OKRs. Where ritual serves clarity and where it performs bureaucracy. The quiet erosion of slack and thinking time.",
      "style_guide": "Observational, slightly critical but not cynical. Name the specific ceremonies. Let irony breathe without becoming the voice.",
      "target_length": 180
