    {
      "section_type": "human_dimension",
      "description": "Turn to the people: onboarding in a 50-repo world, mentorship when no one owns the whole system, burnout disguised as 'high agency,' the loneliness of seniority. The social architecture underneath the technical one.",
      "style_guide": "Empathetic, precise. Avoid platitudes. Use a brief anecdote or composite portrait. Honor the difficulty without melodrama.",
