      "section_type": "complexity_and_choice",
      "description": "Reflect on decision-making amid infinite options. The shift from 'how do I build this?' to 'which of these 47 services do I compose?' The cognitive load of evaluation, the risk of defaulting to fashion. The return to first principles as a quiet rebellion.",
      "style_guide": "Analytical but personal. Frame as internal monologue. Show the mental motion of choosing—and choosing not to choose.",
