      "description": "Return to the opening image, now refracted. What endures? Craft, curiosity, care for the next developer. A definition of 'modern development' not as stack but as stance. End on a note that lingers—an invitation, not a summary.",
      "style_guide": "Lyric, spare. Circle back without repeating. Final sentence should hover.",
